cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'MC/DC: Monte Carlo Dynamic Code'
version: 0.15.3
date-released: '2026-08-15'
license: BSD-3-Clause
type: software
repository-code: 'https://github.com/mcdc-project/mcdc'
url: 'https://mcdc.readthedocs.io/en/stable/'

abstract: >-
  MC/DC is a performant, scalable, and machine-portable
  Python-based Monte Carlo particle transport software
  currently developed in the Center for Advancing the Radiation
  Resilience of Electronics (CARRE).

message: >-
  If you use MC/DC in published work, please cite the JOSS
  article listed as the preferred citation.

